#### S³ Custom Components

**Button.tsx** (~100 LOC)
- Variants: primary, secondary, ghost, destructive
- Sizes: sm (44px), md (44px), lg (48px)
- States: default, hover, active, focus, disabled, loading
- Props: `{ variant, size, leadingIcon, loading, children }`
- Features: gradient backgrounds, scale animation (0.98), focus rings

**Card.tsx** (~60 LOC)
- Variants: default, emphasis, warning
- Gradient backgrounds with backdrop blur
- Border styling with lavender/gold accents
- Props: `{ variant, children, className }`

**Chip.tsx** (~80 LOC)
- Variants: gold, lavender
- States: default, selectable, selected, dismissible
- Used for star system allies with percentages
- Touch targets ≥44px for interactive variants

**Field.tsx** (~100 LOC)
- Form input component with label, helper text, error states
- Icon slot (leading)
- Focus ring animation
- Error state with red border + icon
- Props: `{ label, icon, helperText, error, ...inputProps }`

**StarSystemCrests.tsx** (~150 LOC)
- Six geometric SVG icons (Orion, Sirius, Pleiades, Andromeda, Lyra, Arcturus)
- Export sizes: 24px, 28px, 48px
- CurrentColor fill for theming
- Individual components: `OrionCrest`, `SiriusCrest`, etc.

**AppBar.tsx** (~60 LOC)
- Navigation header with title and back button
- Height: 56px
- Props: `{ title, onBack, showBack }`

**TabBar.tsx** (~80 LOC)
- Bottom navigation with 3 tabs (Home, Community, Profile)
- Active state indicator
- Icon + label for each tab
- Touch targets ≥44px

**Toast.tsx** (~100 LOC)
- Toast notifications (auto-dismiss, top-center)
- InlineAlert variant (dismissible)
- Types: success, info, warning, error
- Icon indicators with semantic colors

**RadialChart.tsx** (~100 LOC)
- SVG-based radial progress chart
- Animated on mount
- Props: `{ percentage, label, color }`
- Used for primary star system percentage display

#### Reusable shadcn/ui Components

From `components/ui` (adapted for React Native):
- Button, Card, Input, Form, Select, Dialog, Tabs
- Alert, Badge, Checkbox, Label, Separator
- Table, Toast, Tooltip, Progress
- Dropdown Menu, Popover, Sheet

From `components/figma`:
