## Appendix B: Integration Checklist

### Flutter Web Build

**Build Command:**
```bash
cd /Users/kingkamehameha/Documents/Kiro/GF\ App/super_dash
flutter build web --release --web-renderer canvaskit
```

**Output Location:**
